WEBVTT

01:30.112 --> 01:32.864
[Episode 5]

01:38.450 --> 01:39.730
Master.

01:39.730 --> 01:42.090
Master, they are all over there.

01:53.571 --> 01:56.291
Master, all prime merchandise
shipped in from various prefectures.

01:56.291 --> 01:57.344
Go.

02:02.131 --> 02:03.651
These are their indentures.

02:03.651 --> 02:04.851
There will be absolutely no future troubles.

02:04.851 --> 02:06.011
Send them all over.

02:06.011 --> 02:07.104
Yes.

02:31.091 --> 02:34.131
Master, these are just some toys,
not worth much.

02:37.450 --> 02:38.496
Open it.

02:54.210 --> 02:55.264
Get up.

02:59.571 --> 03:00.640
How old are you two?

03:00.640 --> 03:01.691
Six.

03:01.691 --> 03:03.291
I'm five.

03:03.291 --> 03:06.210
Tell me, why are you here?

03:06.210 --> 03:09.730
He said if we followed them,
there would be delicious food.

03:09.730 --> 03:12.131
Who said that? Point him out to me, okay?

03:12.131 --> 03:13.490
It was him.

03:14.272 --> 03:16.411
I... Master, it wasn't me.

03:16.411 --> 03:18.411
I don't know anything.
I didn't know there were children.

03:24.730 --> 03:26.330
I'll take you to a good place.

03:26.330 --> 03:29.251
There's lots of delicious food there, okay?

03:29.251 --> 03:30.272
Okay.

03:31.050 --> 03:32.128
Good.

03:34.930 --> 03:37.251
Come on. Be careful.

03:43.610 --> 03:45.770
Master, I really didn't know
there were children inside.

03:45.770 --> 03:47.371
I don't know anything.

03:47.371 --> 03:48.571
He was in charge of this whole thing.

03:48.571 --> 03:50.691
It was him! It was him!

03:50.691 --> 03:51.930
- It wasn't me.
- Master, have mercy.

03:51.930 --> 03:54.050
I wouldn't dare,
even if my life depended on it.

03:55.330 --> 03:57.291
Master, this really
has nothing to do with me.

03:57.291 --> 03:58.531
Master, you really can't blame me for this.

03:58.531 --> 04:00.371
I really don't know anything, Master.

04:00.371 --> 04:02.371
Master, please spare me!

04:02.371 --> 04:03.520
Master! Master!

04:04.650 --> 04:08.971
Did I tell you that you can sell anything
but children?

04:08.971 --> 04:10.450
You did.

04:10.450 --> 04:12.730
Master, this really
has nothing to do with me.

04:12.730 --> 04:14.450
Master, I beg you. Please spare my life.

04:26.890 --> 04:28.131
There won't be a next time.

04:40.611 --> 04:42.090
Boss, luckily...

04:43.090 --> 04:44.770
How many times have I told you?

04:44.770 --> 04:46.571
Master detests this the most.

04:46.571 --> 04:48.650
He has repeatedly stressed
that you cannot touch children.

04:48.650 --> 04:50.432
I was wrong. I wasn't thinking straight.

04:50.432 --> 04:51.456
The price for children
has been high recently.

04:52.128 --> 04:53.251
I will never do it again.

04:56.011 --> 04:58.731
Do you think Master doesn't know who did it?

04:58.731 --> 05:01.811
My dear brother,
you heard it yourself just now.

05:02.571 --> 05:05.491
Master said this is the last time.

05:06.450 --> 05:07.456
Understood.

05:08.970 --> 05:10.850
Boss, I can make it up.

05:12.210 --> 05:15.450
I've tracked down
who destroyed the Shazhou branch.

05:16.096 --> 05:17.131
Really?

05:17.131 --> 05:18.171
Absolutely.

05:23.552 --> 05:25.171
[Imperial Study]

05:25.171 --> 05:26.410
After extensive verification,

05:26.410 --> 05:29.931
the pattern on this arrow
closely resembles a flower known as Xiyan.

05:29.931 --> 05:32.850
It grows in the miasma forest
on the border of Beijian and former Zhongwan,

05:32.850 --> 05:34.330
nourished by the toxic mist.

05:34.330 --> 05:35.970
It blooms at night and withers by day,
feeding only on the living.

05:35.970 --> 05:37.770
It also stands
as a dark symbol of hatred and vengeance.

05:38.410 --> 05:42.171
Using this flower as a mark,
the buyer is definitely not benevolent.

05:42.171 --> 05:43.731
Could it be Beijian?

05:44.371 --> 05:47.410
Although Beijian is poor in iron ore
and has backward weapons,

05:47.410 --> 05:48.530
[Xiyan]
their warhorses are superb.

05:49.251 --> 05:52.171
Their cavalry has been growing for years,
so we must be on high alert.

05:52.171 --> 05:53.571
It's even less likely to be Zhongwan.

05:53.571 --> 05:56.171
Zhongwan surrendered long ago,
and there has been peace for many years.

05:56.890 --> 05:58.290
When Zhongwan was destroyed back then,

05:58.290 --> 06:01.011
its people were exiled to various places,
enslaved for generations.

06:01.011 --> 06:04.410
However, a remnant faction
of the Zhongwan royal family escaped.

06:04.410 --> 06:06.251
Their whereabouts are still unknown.

06:06.251 --> 06:08.290
This must be thoroughly investigated.

06:08.290 --> 06:12.011
Your Majesty, this is like
searching for a needle in a haystack.

06:12.011 --> 06:14.811
Moreover, it involves secrets,
so I can only investigate discreetly,

06:14.811 --> 06:16.171
which is even more difficult.

06:17.811 --> 06:21.011
Since that is the case,
I shall grant you a title.

06:21.011 --> 06:23.090
You can conduct secret investigations

06:23.090 --> 06:26.251
while overseeing the merchants and taxes
across the capital and all prefectures.

06:26.251 --> 06:28.290
Let's name it as the Envoy of Customs.

06:29.131 --> 06:30.571
Envoy of Customs?

06:31.530 --> 06:34.450
Why does it sound a bit unorthodox?

06:34.450 --> 06:38.251
What? Does this title
not match your refined reputation?

06:39.210 --> 06:41.371
Your Majesty, your word is absolute.
This title is truly worthy of me.

06:41.371 --> 06:44.011
Let me first take you to Changle Street
to collect some folk customs.

06:44.011 --> 06:47.491
Lord Envoy,
this palace is full of Lord Xu's spies.

06:47.491 --> 06:49.011
The Shadow Guard just sent word.

06:49.011 --> 06:52.931
Lord Xu's men spread rumors
that this Imperial Exam is just a front.

06:52.931 --> 06:56.571
Upon passing the exams, the talented women
will be assigned to the Music Bureau.

06:56.571 --> 07:00.530
After three months, Lord Xu still harbors
a grudge because of the Ministry of War.

07:01.491 --> 07:04.850
Now, he simply wants to make me lose face
with this Imperial Exam.

07:04.850 --> 07:06.450
He's spreading these rumors

07:06.450 --> 07:10.611
simply because he thinks
women are too timid to weather the storm.

07:10.611 --> 07:13.171
Indeed, some candidates
have given up and returned home.

07:13.171 --> 07:15.210
Your Majesty,
will you just let these rumors run rampant?

07:15.811 --> 07:19.251
Those who serve as officials
should have courage and wisdom.

07:20.051 --> 07:23.530
If they abandon the exams and flee home
over mere rumors today,

07:23.530 --> 07:26.450
how will they
survive the political battles at court?

07:28.131 --> 07:32.330
I should thank Lord Xu
for saving me the Palace Exam.

07:33.450 --> 07:34.560
Your Majesty.

07:38.931 --> 07:40.450
Your Majesty,

07:40.450 --> 07:44.330
by Lord Xu's order,
I present this plaque with respect.

07:48.731 --> 07:50.251
Ancestral precept of the Ning Empire.

07:50.251 --> 07:52.530
[Flatterers face death by a thousand cuts]
A ruler and subject in love,

07:52.530 --> 07:53.571
a threat to the throne
punishable by death to their entire clan?

07:55.171 --> 07:58.131
Emperor Taizong's affair
caused a two-prefecture mutiny.

07:58.131 --> 08:00.090
That was
how this ancestral precept came to be.

08:00.090 --> 08:03.970
Lord Xu is implying that the women's exams
are a cover for your personal feelings.

08:04.650 --> 08:06.410
By Lord Xu's command,

08:07.051 --> 08:09.811
I am to hang this plaque
in the center of the Imperial Study.

08:09.811 --> 08:13.410
If Your Majesty does not permit it,
Lord Xu will come to report in person.

08:13.410 --> 08:14.571
How dare you!

08:14.571 --> 08:16.691
Huo An, how dare you
speak such arrogant words!

08:16.691 --> 08:17.696
Huang Bo.

08:21.770 --> 08:23.090
General Huo, hang it up.

08:26.011 --> 08:27.011
Thank you, Your Majesty.

08:27.808 --> 08:28.992
[Ancestral precept of the Ning Empire]

08:28.992 --> 08:30.530
[If a ruler dotes on his ministers,
he shall issue an edict of self-reproach.]

08:30.530 --> 08:33.050
First, he spread rumors
to scare off the female students.

08:33.050 --> 08:34.611
And now, he brings up the ancestral precept.

08:34.611 --> 08:39.251
Lord Xu made two consecutive moves.
It seems he can't wait any longer.

08:39.251 --> 08:41.611
This stubborn old man is so petty.

08:41.611 --> 08:43.491
You gave him a plaque for Ding Chong,

08:43.491 --> 08:45.890
and he gives an ancestral precept plaque
as a return gift.

08:45.890 --> 08:47.410
Since I have no such intention,

08:47.410 --> 08:50.290
even if it's covered with ancestral precepts,
what is there to fear?

08:50.290 --> 08:52.170
I want to make it perfectly clear
to the court

08:53.091 --> 08:56.170
that women
can also be the sharp blade of the nation.

08:56.170 --> 09:00.410
This court has never been
Lord Xu's one-man show.

09:01.088 --> 09:02.170
Your Majesty, I'll stand with you.

09:02.170 --> 09:04.890
Now, candidates for the women's Imperial Exam
are all staying on Changle Street.

09:04.890 --> 09:07.011
Why not go and see these talents in person?

09:07.770 --> 09:11.570
You might even run into Miss Meng,
the top candidate from Shazhou.

09:11.570 --> 09:14.251
Lord Xu sent this plaque just to warn you.

09:14.251 --> 09:15.570
And you don't even know when to hold back.

09:15.570 --> 09:16.690
I...

09:16.690 --> 09:19.011
Exactly! His Majesty is not going anywhere.

09:19.011 --> 09:22.400
Why not? I'm going.

09:22.400 --> 09:27.008
[Ancestral precept of the Ning Empire]

09:29.251 --> 09:32.211
A thousand lights in the night market
illuminate the green clouds,

09:32.211 --> 09:34.371
and guests flock to the high towers
with red sleeves.

09:35.731 --> 09:39.050
I didn't expect such a bustling scene
outside the palace.

09:40.050 --> 09:41.971
This prosperous era of the Ning Empire
is exactly as your wishes.

09:42.930 --> 09:45.851
The beauties on Changle Street
are indeed each charming in their own way.

09:45.851 --> 09:47.930
The lady on the left has a radiant look,

09:48.770 --> 09:50.731
and the beauty on the right
has red lips and white teeth.

09:52.530 --> 09:53.696
Excellent.

09:57.131 --> 10:00.971
The night scenery of Changle Street
is even more dazzling than the daytime.

10:02.011 --> 10:04.290
This Changle Street,
steeped in luxury and pleasure,

10:04.290 --> 10:07.251
is full of handsome men. I love it so much!

10:07.890 --> 10:08.992
Yan Fu Zhi.

10:13.971 --> 10:15.251
Meng, all this walking has made me hungry.

10:15.251 --> 10:17.451
Today, the waiter told me
that Chunman House also has lamb noodles.

10:17.451 --> 10:19.611
Let's go try them
and see how they differ from Shazhou noodles.

10:19.611 --> 10:20.672
Let's go.

10:22.890 --> 10:24.930
This place of wealth and elegance

10:24.930 --> 10:27.570
tends to breed a sordid underbelly.

10:27.570 --> 10:31.570
Mr. He, this isn't Shazhou.
This is right under the Emperor's nose.

10:31.570 --> 10:33.690
Who would dare cause trouble here?

10:33.690 --> 10:38.371
Then let us hope this grand spectacle
isn't all flash and no substance.

10:38.371 --> 10:42.410
Mr. He, you really always
worry about the empire and its people.

10:42.410 --> 10:44.570
Cousin, we've been walking around
for half the day.

10:44.570 --> 10:46.131
My stomach is protesting.

10:46.131 --> 10:49.251
Let's head to the most famous Chunman House
and grab a bite.

10:51.211 --> 10:53.170
Miss Meng, you're back!

10:53.170 --> 10:55.170
Ma'am, two bowls of lamb noodles.
We're starving.

10:55.170 --> 10:56.251
Coming right up.

10:56.251 --> 10:58.091
Perfect, here's a good spot.
Have a seat, quick.

11:00.170 --> 11:01.530
Mr. He, you're here.

11:02.371 --> 11:04.770
Come on. The same as usual today?

11:07.050 --> 11:08.731
Yeah, please prepare it.

11:08.731 --> 11:09.792
Okay.

11:14.731 --> 11:16.731
Sir, here.

11:16.731 --> 11:18.331
Meng, what are you looking at?

11:21.290 --> 11:22.336
Nothing.

11:25.611 --> 11:26.720
Apricot blossoms.

11:32.770 --> 11:38.611
Meng, in Shazhou, there's nothing
but desert poplars and yellow sand.

11:38.611 --> 11:40.530
How could we ever see such beautiful flowers?

11:56.608 --> 11:59.296
[Menu]

12:00.331 --> 12:02.611
Bring out all your signature dishes,

12:02.611 --> 12:04.050
and also a pot of Shaosanbai wine.

12:04.050 --> 12:05.211
- Coming right up.
- Wait.

12:05.211 --> 12:07.331
You know perfectly well
that Master doesn't touch a drop of alcohol.

12:07.331 --> 12:08.930
You're the one who's craving a drink,
aren't you?

12:08.930 --> 12:11.131
When it comes to drinking,
you're always the one who drinks the most.

12:11.131 --> 12:13.810
Mr. Shen, you usually live beyond your means,

12:13.810 --> 12:15.290
so why are you being so generous today?

12:16.690 --> 12:19.530
Cousin, I rendered great service
on my trip to Shazhou.

12:19.530 --> 12:22.251
It's not too much
to treat a hero to a meal today, is it?

12:22.251 --> 12:24.770
I knew your taking Master out for customs
wasn't that simple.

12:26.091 --> 12:27.890
Three bowls of lamb noodles.

12:27.890 --> 12:28.930
Coming right up.

12:28.930 --> 12:30.410
Three bowls of lamb noodles!

12:30.410 --> 12:33.731
Come on, it can't be
just three bowls of lamb noodles, can it?

12:33.731 --> 12:37.570
What? There's meat, noodles, and vegetables.

12:37.570 --> 12:38.930
What else could you need?

12:38.930 --> 12:43.091
Are you trying to use Master's treat
to win the favor of those girls?

12:44.851 --> 12:45.851
What girls?

12:47.050 --> 12:50.131
It's just that lamb noodles
remind me of that shrewish in Shazhou.

12:51.491 --> 12:52.810
She was truly fierce.

12:56.050 --> 12:57.248
Enjoy your meal.

13:07.971 --> 13:10.011
This broth is so bland.

13:10.011 --> 13:11.570
The lamb is also soft and lacks texture.

13:12.810 --> 13:16.611
Meng, once you become the top scholar here,
I'll open a branch to keep you company.

13:16.611 --> 13:19.410
At that time, Chunman House's sign
will be taken down and used as firewood.

13:26.890 --> 13:29.952
Fu Zhi, the capital
is full of talented people.

13:30.656 --> 13:34.050
I don't know if I'll pass Metropolitan Exam,
let alone win the title of top scholar.

13:34.050 --> 13:36.611
Meng, I heard today

13:36.611 --> 13:39.371
that all the women candidates this time
will be sent to the Music Bureau.

13:39.371 --> 13:41.251
Many people have given up the exam
because of this.

13:41.251 --> 13:42.331
I'm a bit worried about you.

13:44.451 --> 13:46.770
Why care about such absurd rumors?

13:47.491 --> 13:49.131
How do you know they're fake?

13:49.131 --> 13:52.731
His Majesty restarted this Imperial Exam
against all opposition.

13:53.851 --> 13:58.770
This must be the work of senior ministers
opposing the women's Imperial Exam.

13:58.770 --> 14:01.696
They intend to use gossip
to frighten away the timid candidates.

14:01.696 --> 14:04.690
These shameless scoundrels
are utterly lawless.

14:11.011 --> 14:12.128
Eat your noodles.

14:13.731 --> 14:16.971
Master, since returning from Shazhou,
you've been mentioning lamb noodles.

14:25.690 --> 14:28.091
<i>For lamb noodles,
you must drink the soup first.</i>

14:37.650 --> 14:39.251
It's not as good as the ones in Shazhou.

15:01.216 --> 15:02.690
[Imperial Examination Hall]

15:02.690 --> 15:04.530
- Meng, I'm over here!
- Fu Zhi!

15:07.611 --> 15:08.930
Give it to me. I'll take it.

15:09.650 --> 15:10.784
So, how was it?
Was the Metropolitan Exam difficult?

15:10.784 --> 15:11.890
No.

15:11.890 --> 15:13.530
- Did you do well?
- Yes.

15:13.530 --> 15:15.611
I knew a mere Metropolitan Exam
could never stump you.

15:17.211 --> 15:19.211
Miss, you dropped your ink stick.

15:21.331 --> 15:22.368
Thank you, Miss.

15:25.088 --> 15:27.712
[Imperial Examination Hall]

15:29.530 --> 15:31.410
Meng, she's so pretty.

15:32.371 --> 15:36.251
The exam is a hotbed of hidden talents.
She must be no ordinary young lady.

15:37.611 --> 15:38.688
Let's go.

15:39.810 --> 15:42.131
[The Eleventh Lot]
I got you this top lot at Lingquan Temple.

15:42.131 --> 15:44.211
The master who interpreted the lot said
you will definitely pass the exam.

16:02.624 --> 16:03.936
[Imperial Examination Hall]

16:10.530 --> 16:12.211
Meng, what exactly are you looking for?

16:13.731 --> 16:16.611
It's nothing. Maybe I was mistaken.

16:16.611 --> 16:18.491
Are you too tired?

16:18.491 --> 16:21.611
I booked a very nourishing meal
at Chunman House

16:21.611 --> 16:23.650
to give you a good boost. Let's go!

16:25.491 --> 16:26.496
This way.

16:31.170 --> 16:32.288
He's so handsome.

16:38.930 --> 16:40.690
My dear sister, did you miss me
after three days apart?

16:42.810 --> 16:44.930
You've lost so much weight
in just a few days.

16:45.570 --> 16:47.011
Why did you suddenly come here?

16:47.011 --> 16:49.290
Did you cause some trouble again
and need me as a shield?

16:49.930 --> 16:51.011
What nonsense.

16:51.011 --> 16:53.650
As your dear brother,
I naturally care about you.

16:53.650 --> 16:55.690
That's why
I pushed aside my official duties to come.

16:55.690 --> 16:58.570
But you could have entered officialdom
through privilege like me.

16:58.570 --> 17:00.251
Why did you
insist on taking this Imperial Exam?

17:01.331 --> 17:03.850
You are overly solicitous.

17:04.731 --> 17:07.130
Fine. Father sent me to pick you up.

17:07.130 --> 17:09.971
Nian wanted to come,
but he was tied up with official business.

17:09.971 --> 17:11.211
I thought so.

17:11.211 --> 17:14.050
How could Mr. Shen
suddenly be so concerned about my affairs?

17:15.491 --> 17:17.770
Father told me to bring you back in urgent
to celebrate your success.

17:17.770 --> 17:19.731
He even brought out his treasured fine wine.

17:19.731 --> 17:23.251
But it's strange. How did Father know
you would definitely pass?

17:23.251 --> 17:24.451
Do you not believe in me?

17:24.451 --> 17:27.211
Of course, I do.
You could recite the Analects at three,

17:27.211 --> 17:28.411
and mastered the Songs of Chu at seven.

17:28.411 --> 17:31.370
Who in the capital doesn't know Miss Shen,
the great talented lady?

17:31.370 --> 17:34.211
Besides, your brother is none other than me.

17:37.451 --> 17:38.752
Be careful. Don't bump your head.

17:38.752 --> 17:40.512
[Xu Mansion]

17:47.931 --> 17:50.691
Lord Xu,
this year's Metropolitan Exam is over.

17:50.691 --> 17:52.251
The candidates
have all left the examination hall.

17:54.050 --> 17:55.570
Here are the sealed exam papers.

18:10.451 --> 18:11.971
Tomorrow is the day the results are posted.

18:11.971 --> 18:14.290
Today, I'll release a sky lantern for you
to welcome good fortune.

18:14.290 --> 18:17.491
May I enter officialdom with my knowledge
and change my fate.

18:20.971 --> 18:23.330
May I protect the people closest to me.

18:23.330 --> 18:24.411
You definitely will.

18:24.411 --> 18:27.290
When you pass with high honors,
I'll open a bigger Bofeng in the capital.

18:27.290 --> 18:29.090
We'll stay in the capital together.

18:29.090 --> 18:31.050
- Stay in the capital together.
- Stay in the capital.

18:32.691 --> 18:37.530
May Meng pass the exam,
and may Bofeng spread across the Ning Empire.

18:43.520 --> 18:46.240
[With a favorable wind, I rise to the clouds]

19:00.192 --> 19:05.888
[Results]

19:05.888 --> 19:08.090
I passed! I passed!

19:10.290 --> 19:11.651
Sorry, let us through.

19:11.651 --> 19:12.691
Let us through.

19:12.691 --> 19:14.130
Excuse me, let us through.

19:14.130 --> 19:15.264
I passed!

19:16.800 --> 19:18.592
[Results]

19:18.592 --> 19:19.712
[Top Scholar: An Ru Lan]
I also passed.

19:20.651 --> 19:21.728
I passed!

19:23.211 --> 19:24.770
Why isn't your name on it?

19:24.770 --> 19:26.130
Look again.

19:26.130 --> 19:28.011
That's me.

19:28.011 --> 19:29.691
[87th Place]
Here. I'm here!

19:29.691 --> 19:30.752
[88th Place]

19:44.704 --> 19:45.920
[Granted the title of Fellow Graduate]

20:17.411 --> 20:20.610
Why isn't your name on the list?
Could there be a mistake?

20:22.050 --> 20:25.130
Meng. Let me through.

20:25.130 --> 20:28.570
Meng. Meng. Meng!

20:30.691 --> 20:31.971
Could there be a mistake?

20:37.211 --> 20:40.370
Metropolitan Exam papers are reviewed jointly
by Ministry of Rites and Hanlin Academy.

20:41.810 --> 20:43.011
There can't be a mistake.

20:43.011 --> 20:44.330
Then I'll go check again.

20:44.330 --> 20:47.328
Fu Zhi, don't check anymore.

20:50.691 --> 20:51.971
I'm suddenly a bit hungry.

20:54.451 --> 20:55.584
Let's eat.

20:55.584 --> 20:58.176
[Results]

21:13.731 --> 21:16.130
Have the officials in the capital
all grown eyes on the top of their heads?

21:16.770 --> 21:18.290
Your essay wasn't even selected.

21:18.971 --> 21:20.691
I think they are simply blind.

21:22.610 --> 21:24.171
The capital
is full of people and prying eyes.

21:25.850 --> 21:27.290
Don't say such angry words anymore.

21:29.491 --> 21:32.451
The seven prefectures of the Ning Empire
are filled with talents.

21:32.451 --> 21:35.370
Being the top scorer in the Provincial Exam
doesn't guarantee passing Metropolitan Exam.

21:36.290 --> 21:38.090
I don't see what's so good
about the capital anyway.

21:38.090 --> 21:39.891
Not even a decent bowl of lamb noodles here.

21:41.651 --> 21:43.731
Shazhou is not what it used to be now.

21:43.731 --> 21:44.770
You are the top candidate
in the Provincial Exam.

21:44.770 --> 21:47.451
Even if you go back to Shazhou,
you can still secure an official position.

21:47.451 --> 21:49.330
Let's go back to Shazhou together.

21:49.330 --> 21:53.050
There aren't vacancies in the local office
every year.

21:53.850 --> 21:55.411
What does a top candidate in Provincial Exam
count for?

21:56.370 --> 21:58.251
Don't you talk about yourself like that.

21:58.251 --> 22:00.251
Mr. Zhuge didn't leave the mountain
until he was 27,

22:00.251 --> 22:02.691
and Jiang Zi Ya
was not given an important position until 72.

22:02.691 --> 22:05.411
In three years, let's come to the capital
to take the exam again.

22:05.411 --> 22:07.370
Meng, you can definitely do it.

22:11.731 --> 22:13.770
I've walked this path for ten years.

22:16.610 --> 22:18.290
I've worked hard for ten years.

22:19.610 --> 22:21.411
But I still haven't reached the end.

22:26.011 --> 22:27.971
I've already worked so hard.

22:30.451 --> 22:32.130
I've worked so hard.

22:34.610 --> 22:37.211
Meng, I know.

22:37.211 --> 22:38.610
I saw it all.

22:40.130 --> 22:44.370
Even if you didn't pass,
you are still the best in the whole world.

22:44.370 --> 22:46.491
You are the one and only Meng Ting Hui.

22:56.411 --> 22:59.891
The loyal and upright remain silent,
while the sycophantic advance day by day.

22:59.891 --> 23:02.251
As they do not see their faults,
ruin is the result.

23:03.770 --> 23:07.251
The style of this essay is sharp,
and every word hits the current ills.

23:07.251 --> 23:09.011
Yet it subtly contains a will for reform.

23:10.211 --> 23:13.952
What is even rarer is that
it is sharp and pointed but knows its limits.

23:13.952 --> 23:16.330
[Breaking the Deadlock with Women]
Breaking the deadlock with women?

23:16.330 --> 23:17.691
Such shocking words

23:18.891 --> 23:20.931
do sound exactly like
something she would say.

23:20.931 --> 23:23.171
Huang Bo, who is
the top scorer of the Metropolitan Exam?

23:23.171 --> 23:27.011
Your Majesty, the top scorer
is An Ru Lan from the An family of Qingzhou.

23:33.536 --> 23:35.411
[Candidate, An Ru Lan]

23:35.411 --> 23:38.411
What about Meng Ting Hui?
What place did she get?

23:38.411 --> 23:41.891
Miss Meng... She failed.

23:47.251 --> 23:50.691
It is normal for the world
to be vast and full of many talents,

23:53.810 --> 23:56.891
but the style of writing and the arguments
are exactly the same.

23:56.891 --> 23:58.330
How could it be a coincidence?

24:14.491 --> 24:17.090
The lot from Lingquan Temple
isn't accurate after all.

24:19.411 --> 24:21.451
Our Dafo Temple in Shazhou is better.

24:58.130 --> 25:01.651
Meng, I prepared
your favorite fruits and apricot skin cakes.

25:05.731 --> 25:07.411
It's so dark. Why didn't you light a lamp?

25:21.011 --> 25:23.651
Meng! Meng! Meng!

25:25.050 --> 25:27.931
Meng! Meng!

25:32.011 --> 25:33.050
What's wrong? What's wrong?

25:35.770 --> 25:37.171
Meng!

25:37.171 --> 25:39.330
A physician! Quick, call a physician!

25:39.330 --> 25:41.530
Shun! Shun!

25:41.530 --> 25:44.770
Meng! Meng! Meng!

25:47.770 --> 25:49.850
Meng, wake up! Meng!

26:23.090 --> 26:26.610
Meng, Meng, you're awake.

26:27.850 --> 26:31.891
You are so heartless.
We agreed to go back to Shazhou together.

26:31.891 --> 26:35.451
You didn't keep your word
and actually tried to take your own life.

26:35.451 --> 26:39.731
The physician said if it had been later,
even the gods couldn't have saved you.

26:39.731 --> 26:42.370
It was just a failed exam.
You were so foolish!

26:43.451 --> 26:44.512
Take it easy.

26:48.810 --> 26:50.610
Someone tried to kill me.

26:50.610 --> 26:52.130
Someone tried to kill you?

26:53.451 --> 26:55.251
Who? Did you see clearly?

26:55.971 --> 26:58.691
It was too dark. I couldn't see clearly.

27:00.251 --> 27:02.251
But he was very strong.

27:02.251 --> 27:06.211
He could have killed me directly,
but he tried to make it look like suicide.

27:07.251 --> 27:10.050
He wanted me dead
but was afraid of an investigation.

27:12.290 --> 27:14.931
Fu Zhi, I must have gotten in someone's way.

27:16.290 --> 27:18.691
There must be something fishy
about my failing the exam.

27:18.691 --> 27:21.891
That scoundrel! We must catch him,

27:21.891 --> 27:23.770
hang him from the roof beam,
and beat him for three days.

27:25.090 --> 27:29.610
But we just arrived in the capital
and haven't offended anyone.

27:29.610 --> 27:31.130
Who would do such a thing?

27:34.451 --> 27:38.850
If those people find out I'm still alive,
they won't let me go.

27:41.491 --> 27:43.411
Let's leave here first,
and figure out a plan.

27:43.411 --> 27:45.290
Okay, I'll go pack our things.

27:45.891 --> 27:47.451
Forget it. Survival is the priority.

27:47.451 --> 27:48.491
Let's go right now.

27:53.290 --> 27:54.651
- Let's go.
- Be careful.

27:55.330 --> 27:58.130
His Majesty attaches great importance
to the women's Imperial Exam.

27:58.130 --> 28:00.011
He was especially moved
by An Ru Lan's policy essay.

28:00.011 --> 28:01.330
He personally appointed her
as the top candidate in Metropolitan Exam.

28:01.931 --> 28:04.411
He even had it copied
and distributed to all prefectures for study.

28:05.090 --> 28:07.424
Look, this is my favorite line in here.

28:07.424 --> 28:10.810
The loyal and upright remain silent,
while the sycophantic advance day by day.

28:10.810 --> 28:14.411
As they do not see their faults,
ruin is the result.

28:14.411 --> 28:16.171
Such an essay, such spirit.

28:16.171 --> 28:17.408
No wonder she is the top candidate
in the Metropolitan Exam.

28:17.408 --> 28:18.411
- Yeah.
- Indeed.

28:18.411 --> 28:20.211
It's so well-written.

28:20.211 --> 28:21.344
Meng.

28:22.971 --> 28:24.570
How can you be so rude?

28:24.570 --> 28:26.432
[The loyal and upright remain silent,
while the sycophantic advance day by day.]

28:27.330 --> 28:28.530
This is my policy essay.

28:29.570 --> 28:32.050
You failed the Metropolitan Exam.
How dare you claim this is your essay?

28:32.050 --> 28:33.610
- Have you lost your mind?
- You...

28:33.610 --> 28:36.651
You hung yourself last night for failure,
and now you're spouting such nonsense.

28:36.651 --> 28:38.370
You should have your head examined.

28:38.370 --> 28:40.770
Miss Meng, exam fraud
is strictly forbidden in our empire.

28:40.770 --> 28:42.130
Such a thing could never happen.

28:42.130 --> 28:43.776
If Meng says it's hers, then it's hers.

28:43.776 --> 28:46.530
Hang herself? That's just ridiculous!

28:46.530 --> 28:49.610
If I hear such rumors again,
I'll tear your mouths apart.

28:49.610 --> 28:50.810
Meng, let's go.

28:51.651 --> 28:52.736
You...

28:56.850 --> 28:59.171
Meng, I knew you could pass.

28:59.171 --> 29:01.850
An Ru Lan actually
dared to steal your policy essay.

29:01.850 --> 29:04.704
Let's go report her to the authorities now
and take back your rightful title.

29:05.440 --> 29:06.530
[Chunman House]

29:06.530 --> 29:07.570
It won't be that simple.

29:08.731 --> 29:11.651
This is a much bigger mess than we thought.

29:12.691 --> 29:14.050
The Ministry of Rites
is in charge of the Imperial Examination.

29:14.691 --> 29:16.891
Without collusion from within,

29:16.891 --> 29:18.530
how would An Ru Lan dare to steal my essay?

29:19.171 --> 29:22.251
If we go to the authorities now,
I'm afraid we'll be walking into a trap.

29:23.971 --> 29:26.011
This capital is even more ruthless
than Shazhou.

29:26.850 --> 29:29.931
You've almost died once already. I'm scared.

29:30.971 --> 29:32.090
I'll take you back to Shazhou.

29:32.090 --> 29:33.651
But I clearly passed.

29:34.530 --> 29:36.090
I am the top candidate
in the Metropolitan Exam, Fu Zhi.

29:37.931 --> 29:39.931
I can't pretend like nothing happened.

29:40.891 --> 29:42.651
I've walked this path for ten years.

29:43.651 --> 29:47.171
To give up like this, I can't accept it.

29:50.330 --> 29:52.370
[Chunman House]
Fine. If you won't go, then we stay.

29:52.370 --> 29:53.770
I'll be with you.

29:53.770 --> 29:56.251
No matter how deep the abyss,
I will face it with you.

29:58.651 --> 30:01.810
It's just that we are strangers here.

30:02.731 --> 30:06.411
Aren't Mr. He and Mr. Shen in the capital?

30:06.411 --> 30:07.731
Can we go find them for help?

30:10.171 --> 30:12.171
Right now, things are still unclear.

30:12.971 --> 30:14.731
Rushing to find them might not be useful.

30:16.050 --> 30:18.090
So what should we do?

30:18.090 --> 30:21.610
They want to silence me
but don't want to make a big deal out of it.

30:22.251 --> 30:26.330
In that case, we'll make the matter known
throughout the whole city.

30:26.330 --> 30:29.411
When we go to the authorities then,
they will have to think twice.

30:31.200 --> 30:33.251
[Imperial Examination Hall]
His Majesty has arrived.

30:37.491 --> 30:39.810
Greetings, Your Majesty.

30:39.810 --> 30:41.570
Everyone, rise.

30:41.570 --> 30:42.891
Thank you, Your Majesty.

30:46.011 --> 30:49.770
Lord Zhang, I cast a divination this morning.

30:49.770 --> 30:54.691
It said that there is a hidden pearl
among the failed papers.

30:54.691 --> 30:56.810
Do you think it's possible
that someone was truly so short-sighted

30:56.810 --> 30:59.411
and threw this luminous pearl away
as a fish eye?

30:59.411 --> 31:00.768
Your Majesty, you must be joking.

31:00.768 --> 31:03.570
We have always been meticulous in grading.
How could we...

31:05.651 --> 31:09.810
I was just saying. Why are you so frightened?

31:10.691 --> 31:11.936
Huang Bo.

31:13.171 --> 31:18.810
Do you think Lord Zhang looks guilty?

31:18.810 --> 31:19.936
He does.

31:21.370 --> 31:23.211
Forgive my boldness.

31:23.211 --> 31:24.691
Recently, people say

31:24.691 --> 31:28.610
that a failed candidate is holding a grudge
and deliberately spreading rumors.

31:28.610 --> 31:31.251
I fear someone is trying to deceive you

31:31.251 --> 31:33.050
to disrupt the court's
grand ceremony of talent selection.

31:33.050 --> 31:35.251
Then I might as well make a bet with you.

31:36.211 --> 31:38.731
If I find a pearl among these failed papers,

31:40.090 --> 31:45.130
how about I borrow your head as a kickball?

31:46.211 --> 31:48.290
Your Majesty,
you are busy with state affairs.

31:48.290 --> 31:52.011
We have already eliminated mediocre essays.

31:52.011 --> 31:55.691
How about I present the superior works
of the selected candidates,

31:55.691 --> 31:58.651
so you can review them while drinking tea?

32:00.770 --> 32:03.691
What are you standing there for?
Bring out the papers.

32:03.691 --> 32:04.768
Yes, Your Majesty.

32:04.768 --> 32:05.891
Zheng Ru.

32:24.211 --> 32:26.850
According to the article,
the top candidate's policy essay was faked.

32:26.850 --> 32:29.570
Then could it be possible
that other candidates' essays were stolen?

32:29.570 --> 32:32.651
Yes. Just as it says here,

32:32.651 --> 32:35.971
all papers from the Metropolitan Exam
should be open to the public, right?

32:35.971 --> 32:37.610
- Yes.
- Make them public!

32:37.610 --> 32:38.971
- Make them public!
- Make the papers public!

32:38.971 --> 32:42.330
Make the papers public!
Reject the shady dealings!

32:42.330 --> 32:43.488
Make the papers public!

32:44.530 --> 32:45.696
What are you doing?

32:46.368 --> 32:47.451
Stop reading! Hand it over!

32:47.451 --> 32:48.770
Who are they?

32:48.770 --> 32:51.211
Why are they
just like the Heihu Crew in Shazhou?

32:51.211 --> 32:53.011
They must be the ones who want to kill me.

32:53.011 --> 32:56.090
They failed last night,
and the situation has escalated now.

32:56.850 --> 32:57.971
They will definitely not let me off.

32:57.971 --> 33:00.411
There are lawless villains
even in the capital.

33:00.411 --> 33:01.731
How dare they act so openly.

33:04.768 --> 33:05.770
Seize them!

33:05.770 --> 33:08.171
They are coming for me. Let's split up.

33:08.171 --> 33:10.731
You go find Mr. Shen in the Shen Mansion.
There might be a slim chance.

33:10.731 --> 33:12.530
I will go to the Capital Prefecture
in a very public way.

33:12.530 --> 33:14.770
Under the public eye,
the officials won't dare to be biased.

33:14.770 --> 33:15.776
Go, now!

33:15.776 --> 33:18.656
[Gu Mansion]

33:20.971 --> 33:23.810
Lord Gu. Lord Gu.

33:24.731 --> 33:28.770
Someone wrote an article claiming that
the top candidate's essay was someone else's.

33:28.770 --> 33:31.050
Now, it's spread all over the streets.

33:31.050 --> 33:32.850
Cheating in Imperial Examination
is a matter for the Ministry of Rites.

33:33.691 --> 33:35.411
The bigger the mess, the better.

33:36.130 --> 33:39.810
Let's just sit on the wall
and watch this good show unfold.

33:39.810 --> 33:41.290
[The incident of An Ru Lan
Stealing the Policy Essay]

33:41.290 --> 33:42.370
Meng Ting Hui?

33:43.850 --> 33:45.171
Have you investigated this person?

33:48.011 --> 33:53.211
Lord Xu, this is the woman
who helped His Majesty out in Shazhou.

33:53.211 --> 33:55.251
She is well-versed
in the tricks of the underworld,

33:55.251 --> 33:58.050
and acts in a cunning and unpredictable way,
making her hard to guard against.

33:58.050 --> 34:02.530
If she had not obstructed me,
I'd have brought His Majesty back long ago.

34:02.530 --> 34:07.891
No wonder since returning from Shazhou,
His Majesty's been more absurd and defiant.

34:07.891 --> 34:12.291
It turns out his mind
was bewitched by such a lowly, wicked woman.

34:12.291 --> 34:16.730
A mere ant
dares to meddle in the court affairs.

34:17.331 --> 34:18.931
This woman can't live.

34:24.210 --> 34:25.331
Looking at it this way,

34:27.210 --> 34:31.011
a bit of trouble might not be a bad thing.

34:31.011 --> 34:34.130
Meng Ting Hui scattered the article rubbings
all over the capital.

34:34.130 --> 34:37.851
Although the Metropolitan Exam
was solely under Lord Zhang's charge,

34:37.851 --> 34:41.570
it remains the duty of the Ministry of Rites.
What if it implicates you...

34:42.331 --> 34:45.931
Why so anxious?
I advised His Majesty long ago

34:45.931 --> 34:48.610
that an Imperial Exam for women
is utterly absurd.

34:49.771 --> 34:52.250
But His Majesty went his own way.

34:52.250 --> 34:54.050
Now, look what happened.

34:54.050 --> 34:58.451
Meng Ting Hui stirred up such a scandal
that makes us the laughingstock of the world.

34:58.451 --> 35:02.090
The one who should be anxious right now
is His Majesty.

35:02.090 --> 35:04.291
I heard that His Majesty
has already gone to the examination hall.

35:05.130 --> 35:09.371
The Son of Heaven,
leaving the palace for a wicked woman?

35:09.371 --> 35:13.011
He is simply bewitched and utterly muddled.

35:13.811 --> 35:15.050
Since that's the case,

35:15.931 --> 35:21.610
I will make sure the women's Imperial Exam
is completely shut down.

35:21.610 --> 35:24.130
Your Majesty, forgive my crime.
I deserve to die.

35:24.130 --> 35:27.008
I was careless just now
and fell into a water vat.

35:27.008 --> 35:29.971
I tried my best to salvage the exam papers,
but they...

35:31.650 --> 35:33.650
Are you hurt?

35:33.650 --> 35:35.730
Should I summon the imperial physician
to take a look?

35:35.730 --> 35:40.090
Your Majesty, thank you for your concern.
I am fine.

35:40.090 --> 35:45.011
Since you are fine,
please bring the transcribed copies again.

35:46.570 --> 35:48.050
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

35:48.050 --> 35:50.931
Last night, a pack of rats
got into the side rooms of the office.

35:50.931 --> 35:55.170
They chewed up all the transcribed papers.

35:56.411 --> 36:01.730
Those rats really should
fall into a water vat and drown.

36:04.050 --> 36:05.971
Your Majesty, you jest.

36:10.090 --> 36:13.851
The two of you
are truly diligent in your duties,

36:13.851 --> 36:15.210
and put in your utmost effort.

36:16.331 --> 36:19.170
Staying in the Ministry of Rites
is indeed a waste of your talents.

36:20.130 --> 36:21.690
Your Majesty, you flatter us.

36:23.411 --> 36:26.011
Your Majesty, the office buildings
are old and in disrepair.

36:26.811 --> 36:29.291
We urged the Ministry of Revenue many times,

36:29.291 --> 36:33.650
but the funds have been delayed,
which caused this disaster.

36:33.650 --> 36:37.210
As Vice Minister of Rites,
I should naturally be punished.

36:37.210 --> 36:40.730
Good. We'll do as Lord Zhang says.

36:40.730 --> 36:43.530
Huang Bo, what is the punishment
according to the law?

36:43.530 --> 36:46.931
Your Majesty, according to the law,
for destroying the Imperial Exam papers,

36:46.931 --> 36:49.771
each offender
shall receive 30 strokes of the heavy plank.

36:49.771 --> 36:53.170
You will carry it out personally.
Beat them right here in the courtyard.

36:59.808 --> 37:02.272
[Jinfen Store]

37:04.090 --> 37:06.411
Miss, the pastries you wanted
are also bought.

37:06.411 --> 37:08.411
Good. Help me carry the rouge I bought.

37:08.411 --> 37:09.440
Yes.

37:15.971 --> 37:17.024
After her!

37:17.024 --> 37:18.090
Quick!

37:18.976 --> 37:20.128
Where is she?

37:20.771 --> 37:21.811
Go check over there.

37:21.811 --> 37:25.451
To find out how the young gentleman
solves the mystery, tune in next time!

37:25.451 --> 37:27.291
Great!

37:32.288 --> 37:33.344
What's this?

37:33.971 --> 37:37.210
Everyone, I am Meng Ting Hui,
top Provincial Exam candidate from Shazhou.

37:37.210 --> 37:39.210
I came to the capital for Metropolitan Exam
but failed miserably.

37:39.210 --> 37:42.170
However, I discovered that the policy essay
by this year's top scorer, An Ru Lan,

37:42.170 --> 37:44.570
is exactly the same as the one I wrote.

37:44.570 --> 37:48.451
I've resolved to go to the Capital Prefecture
and ask the Prefect to preside over the case.

37:52.331 --> 37:56.931
If you are interested,
please follow me to watch the show,

37:56.931 --> 38:01.771
and see who is the real top candidate,
Meng Ting Hui or An Ru Lan?

38:02.411 --> 38:06.291
If any villains attack me,
please lend a hand out of justice,

38:06.291 --> 38:08.170
tie them up and take them
to the Prefecture, too.

38:08.170 --> 38:09.730
I will reward you handsomely.

38:16.210 --> 38:18.730
Okay!

38:18.730 --> 38:21.130
Boss, there are too many people here.
It's hard to make a move.

38:21.130 --> 38:23.170
Send someone to ask the Second Master
how to deal with this woman.

38:25.170 --> 38:26.371
You are...

38:26.371 --> 38:28.411
Miss, we met outside the examination hall.

38:28.411 --> 38:31.011
Are you the daughter of Grand Tutor Shen
and the younger sister of Mr. Shen?

38:32.170 --> 38:34.050
You're the third one this month.

38:34.050 --> 38:36.971
Whatever romantic debts my brother owes you,
you can find him at his residence.

38:36.971 --> 38:39.050
Why do you keep sneaking into my carriage?
Driver!

38:39.050 --> 38:41.371
Miss Shen, I met Mr. Shen in Shazhou.

38:41.371 --> 38:43.250
I came to find him this time to seek justice.

38:43.971 --> 38:45.152
Seek justice?

38:47.371 --> 38:48.971
Where is she? You go over there!

38:48.971 --> 38:50.170
Go! The rest of you, follow me!

38:52.291 --> 38:55.250
[An Ru Lan Stealing the Policy Essay]
How can you prove Meng Ting Hui wrote it?

38:55.250 --> 38:57.291
And how do I know
you are not framing someone else?

38:58.011 --> 38:59.130
According to the Laws of Ning Empire,

38:59.130 --> 39:02.610
cheating in the Imperial Examination
is punishable by exile of 3,000 li,

39:02.610 --> 39:04.690
and falsely accusing the top candidate
is also a serious crime.

39:05.730 --> 39:08.891
Miss Shen, I guarantee with my life
that this is absolutely true.

39:08.891 --> 39:11.170
If there is a single false word,
you can send me to the officials.

39:12.690 --> 39:13.728
Stop!

39:16.011 --> 39:17.971
Miss, a group of people are
blocking the road outside.

39:19.811 --> 39:22.130
Those people outside are coming for you?

39:23.491 --> 39:26.011
Last night,
Meng Ting Hui was almost silenced.

39:26.011 --> 39:28.130
We are outnumbered and weak,
so we have to make the matter public.

39:28.130 --> 39:29.971
But we were chased by these people.

39:29.971 --> 39:31.771
Meng's fate is now unknown.

39:31.771 --> 39:33.851
Miss Shen, I beg you
to act out of justice and save her.

39:36.130 --> 39:38.650
Someone spotted them
getting into this exact carriage.

39:38.650 --> 39:40.451
People in the carriage, get down here!

39:42.931 --> 39:43.968
Don't worry.

39:48.411 --> 39:52.931
Intercepting an official's family carriage
warrants 60 strokes and a year of labor.

39:52.931 --> 39:54.811
Those bearing weapons
shall face an aggravated penalty.

39:54.811 --> 39:55.931
Withdraw immediately!

39:56.690 --> 39:58.570
So it's a lady from an official's family.

39:58.570 --> 40:01.331
Sorry, no offense.

40:01.331 --> 40:04.011
But we are just looking for a girl.

40:05.411 --> 40:06.528
You...

40:19.170 --> 40:20.690
Who is so blind...

40:25.504 --> 40:28.224
[Di Nian, Captain of the Divine Guard]

40:28.224 --> 40:29.411
Nian.

40:29.411 --> 40:30.730
Captain Di.

40:30.730 --> 40:32.411
The Divine Guards are patrolling the city.

40:32.411 --> 40:35.851
You are gathering a mob to cause trouble
and harass civilians.

40:35.851 --> 40:37.210
- Seize them all!
- Yes!

40:37.210 --> 40:38.411
Guys, retreat!

40:40.090 --> 40:41.120
Stop!

40:49.730 --> 40:52.650
Zhi Li, were you frightened?

40:52.650 --> 40:53.824
I'm fine.

40:54.851 --> 40:57.291
Zhi Li,
let me escort you back to the residence then.

40:57.291 --> 40:58.371
Where is His Majesty now?

41:06.650 --> 41:08.971
Did I just count wrong?

41:10.811 --> 41:12.451
You can't even count properly?

41:12.451 --> 41:15.250
Your Majesty, please see clearly.
I took pity on the two lords,

41:15.250 --> 41:17.610
and in a moment of weakness,
the numbers got messed up.

41:17.610 --> 41:21.491
Since you messed it up,
start over from the beginning.

41:22.250 --> 41:26.610
No! It's 15.

41:26.610 --> 41:28.931
You remember it quite clearly.

41:28.931 --> 41:30.530
It seems the beating isn't heavy enough yet.

41:30.530 --> 41:32.491
Huang Bo, continue.

41:36.851 --> 41:39.411
A hundred people were selected
in this year's Metropolitan Exam.

41:39.411 --> 41:42.451
Yet as the top candidate of Shazhou,
Meng Ting Hui failed.

41:42.451 --> 41:44.291
I find this suspicious.

41:44.291 --> 41:45.931
I wasn't sure before.

41:45.931 --> 41:47.971
But now that the papers have been destroyed,

41:47.971 --> 41:50.931
tell me, is this a coincidence?

41:51.851 --> 41:54.811
I truly don't know.

41:54.811 --> 41:56.530
Then find someone who does know
and interrogate him.

41:56.530 --> 41:58.331
Bring all the invigilators,

41:58.331 --> 41:59.971
transcribers, sealers, and graders

41:59.971 --> 42:00.971
for this year's Metropolitan Exam here.

42:00.971 --> 42:03.331
It'll take some time
to investigate these people.

42:03.331 --> 42:07.690
How about beating him with 30 strokes first?

42:11.090 --> 42:14.610
I'll confess! I'm willing to confess!

42:15.811 --> 42:18.210
Imperial Exam fraud! A grave injustice!

42:18.210 --> 42:19.616
Everyone, come and see!

42:20.224 --> 42:21.371
There's actually such a thing?

42:21.371 --> 42:22.610
Cheating in the Imperial Exam?

42:22.610 --> 42:24.291
There's some excitement to watch. Let's go.

42:25.050 --> 42:27.931
I am Meng Ting Hui, the top candidate
in the Provincial Exam from Shazhou.

42:28.931 --> 42:31.451
An Ru Lan stole my policy essay
in the Metropolitan Exam.

42:31.451 --> 42:33.610
Now, I'm going to the Capital Prefecture
to ask the authorities for justice,

42:33.610 --> 42:36.090
expose the truth of the exam fraud,

42:36.090 --> 42:38.210
and restore fairness to the Imperial Exam.

42:38.210 --> 42:39.648
It's Meng Ting Hui!

42:39.648 --> 42:41.570
Go, follow her.
Let's go to the Capital Prefecture.

42:41.570 --> 42:44.480
Let's go to the Capital Prefecture together
to seek justice!

42:44.480 --> 42:47.520
Seek justice!

42:47.520 --> 42:49.451
[A Bright Mirror Hung High]

42:49.451 --> 42:50.656
I am Meng Ting Hui.

42:50.656 --> 42:54.411
I accuse An Ru Lan, the top candidate,
of stealing my policy essay.

42:54.411 --> 42:55.650
My lord, please uphold justice for me.

42:56.331 --> 43:02.371
Confucius said: "Think thrice before you act.
Twice is sufficient."

43:02.371 --> 43:06.610
You spread this article all over the capital,
stirring up a city-wide storm.

43:06.610 --> 43:07.851
Do you have any evidence?

43:07.851 --> 43:11.170
My lord, you can summon An Ru Lan
for a face-to-face confrontation in court.

43:11.170 --> 43:15.570
My lord, those commoners outside
were all brought here by her.

43:17.971 --> 43:19.050
Summon Huiyuan An.
